    {
      "input": "*He asks Bartolomhew who they think he is and where he comes from.*",
      "outcome": "success",
      "exception": null,
      "narration": "Bartolomhew regards Nicco with his habitual paternal ease, the beneficent smile never quite reaching his eyes. \"Who you are? A gentleman with questions, clearly. As for where you come from—\" He spreads his hands in a gesture of mild apology, the movement unhurried and deliberate. \"I haven't the faintest notion. West District, by your accent? Beyond that, you'd know better than I.\" His tone remains warm, professionally solicitous, as if any answer would satisfy him equally. \"Is there some particular introduction you're hoping for? I'm sure we can arrange one through proper channels.\"",
